e Marbeck, and Aubry Dullin.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A playful, poignant love letter to cinema, Nouvelle Vague reimagines the making of Jean-Luc Godard\u2019s Breathless in an exuberant exploration of the youthful rebellion.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":106,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sRqWbsdACzg\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002634\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008603\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012851\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012852\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012853\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012854\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012855\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012856\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012857\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"8ddd1648-0036-4a88-99b9-4b2eb84d4838\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006693\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008259\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Altitude Film Distribution\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006609\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":149,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PNDVyJU99M0\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCr